00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,900
Look at the scaling mathematics on Slide 13.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:17,430
In the old chatbot model, the ratio was strictly 1 to 1. One human worker was tethered to one chat box. If you had 5 tasks, you had to wait 5 separate times.

3
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:30,730
But as an Intelligence Architect, your supervisory ratio jumps from 1:1 to 1:50! One single architect can direct 50 specialized agents running in parallel.

4
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:40,810
One agent scans financial SEC filings, another generates daily market charts, another monitors server logs, and another drafts emails.

5
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:52,960
And they operate with 24/7 continuous uptime without fatigue. That is how a single individual can operate with the output of an entire enterprise department.

